---
title: Table Reservation & Queue Management Flow
config:
  theme: default
---
sequenceDiagram
    participant C as Customer
    participant MA as Mobile App
    participant API as OrdrMate API
    participant TS as Table Service
    participant TM as Table Manager
    participant TQM as Table Queue Manager
    participant RM as Reservation Queue
    participant WS as WebSocket Handler
    participant BM as Branch Manager
    participant FCM as Firebase Messaging

    Note over C, FCM: Table Availability Check
    C->>MA: View restaurant tables
    MA->>API: GET /api/table/restaurant/{restaurantId}
    API->>TS: GetRestaurantTables()
    TS->>TM: GetAvailableTablesWithStatus()
    TM-->>TS: Table availability data
    TS-->>API: Available tables list
    API-->>MA: Tables with real-time status

    Note over C, FCM: Immediate Table Reservation (Available Table)
    C->>MA: Select available table
    MA->>API: POST /api/table/reserve (ReserveTableDto)
    API->>+TS: ReserveTable()
    TS->>TM: CheckTableAvailability()
    TM-->>TS: Table status confirmation
    
    alt Table Available
        TS->>TM: MarkTableAsReserved()
        TM->>TM: Update table status
        TM->>WS: NotifyTableStatusChange()
        WS->>BM: Real-time table update
        
        TS->>TS: Create reservation record
        TS->>FCM: SendReservationConfirmation()
        FCM->>C: Reservation confirmed notification
        TS-->>-API: Reservation successful
        API-->>MA: Reservation confirmation
        
    else Table No Longer Available
        TS-->>API: Table unavailable error
        API-->>MA: Please select another table
    end

    Note over C, FCM: Queue-Based Reservation (Busy Restaurant)
    C->>MA: Request table (all occupied)
    MA->>API: POST /api/table/join-queue (JoinQueueDto)
    API->>+TQM: AddToReservationQueue()
    TQM->>RM: AddCustomerToQueue()
    RM->>RM: Calculate queue position & wait time
    
    TQM->>TM: EstimateWaitingTime()
    TM->>TM: Analyze current occupancy patterns
    TM->>TM: Calculate average dining duration
    TM-->>TQM: Estimated waiting time
    
    RM-->>TQM: Queue position & estimated time
    TQM->>FCM: SendQueueConfirmation()
    FCM->>C: Queue position notification
    TQM-->>-API: Queue registration successful
    API-->>MA: Queue position details

    Note over C, FCM: Queue Management & Updates
    loop Queue Processing
        TM->>TM: Monitor table occupancy
        
        alt Customer Finishes Dining
            BM->>API: PUT /api/table/free/{tableId}
            API->>TS: FreeTable()
            TS->>TM: MarkTableAsAvailable()
            TM->>WS: NotifyTableAvailable()
            WS->>BM: Table status update
            
            TM->>TQM: ProcessNextInQueue()
            TQM->>RM: GetNextCustomerInQueue()
            RM-->>TQM: Next customer details
            
            alt Queue Not Empty
                TQM->>FCM: NotifyTableReady()
                FCM->>C: Your table is ready!
                TQM->>TQM: Start reservation timer (15 minutes)
                
                Note over TQM, FCM: Customer Response Handling
                alt Customer Accepts (within 15 min)
                    C->>MA: Accept table notification
                    MA->>API: PUT /api/table/confirm-reservation/{queueId}
                    API->>TQM: ConfirmReservation()
                    TQM->>RM: RemoveFromQueue()
                    TQM->>TS: FinalizeReservation()
                    TS->>TM: AssignTableToCustomer()
                    TM->>WS: NotifyTableAssigned()
                    WS->>BM: Customer arrived notification
                    
                else Customer Doesn't Respond (timeout)
                    TQM->>TQM: Reservation timeout triggered
                    TQM->>RM: RemoveFromQueue()
                    TQM->>FCM: SendTimeoutNotification()
                    FCM->>C: Reservation expired
                    TQM->>TQM: ProcessNextInQueue()
                    
                else Customer Declines
                    C->>MA: Decline table offer
                    MA->>API: PUT /api/table/decline-reservation/{queueId}
                    API->>TQM: DeclineReservation()
                    TQM->>RM: RemoveFromQueue()
                    TQM->>TQM: ProcessNextInQueue()
                end
            end
        end
        
        Note over TQM, FCM: Queue Position Updates
        TQM->>RM: UpdateQueuePositions()
        RM->>RM: Recalculate waiting times
        RM-->>TQM: Updated queue data
        TQM->>FCM: SendQueueUpdates()
        FCM->>C: Updated queue position
    end

    Note over C, FCM: Advanced Queue Features
    rect rgb(240, 255, 240)
        Note over C, FCM: Customer Queue Management
        C->>MA: Check queue status
        MA->>API: GET /api/table/queue-status/{customerId}
        API->>TQM: GetCustomerQueueStatus()
        TQM->>RM: FindCustomerInQueue()
        RM-->>TQM: Current position & wait time
        TQM-->>API: Queue status data
        API-->>MA: Real-time queue position
        
        C->>MA: Leave queue (optional)
        MA->>API: DELETE /api/table/leave-queue/{queueId}
        API->>TQM: RemoveFromQueue()
        TQM->>RM: UpdateQueueAfterRemoval()
        RM->>FCM: NotifyQueueUpdate()
        FCM->>C: Queue exit confirmation
    end

    Note over C, FCM: Branch Manager Queue Control
    rect rgb(240, 240, 255)
        BM->>API: GET /api/table/queue-overview/{branchId}
        API->>TQM: GetBranchQueueOverview()
        TQM->>RM: GetAllActiveQueues()
        RM-->>TQM: Complete queue data
        TQM-->>API: Queue management dashboard
        API-->>BM: Real-time queue visualization
        
        Note over BM, FCM: Manual Queue Management
        BM->>API: PUT /api/table/priority-queue/{customerId}
        API->>TQM: MoveToPriority()
        TQM->>RM: ReorderQueue()
        RM->>FCM: NotifyQueueChanges()
        FCM->>C: Priority queue notification
        
        BM->>API: PUT /api/table/extend-reservation/{tableId}
        API->>TS: ExtendReservationTime()
        TS->>TM: UpdateTableTimer()
        TM->>WS: NotifyExtension()
        WS->>BM: Extension confirmed
    end

    Note over C, FCM: Error Scenarios
    rect rgb(255, 240, 240)
        Note right of TQM: Queue Management Errors
        alt Queue Full
            TQM-->>API: Queue capacity exceeded
            API-->>MA: Restaurant at capacity
            MA-->>C: Try again later message
        end
        
        alt Table Assignment Conflict
            TM->>TM: Detect double booking
            TM->>TQM: ResolveConflict()
            TQM->>RM: ReassignTable()
            RM->>FCM: NotifyTableChange()
            FCM->>C: Table change notification
        end
        
        alt Network Disconnection
            MA->>MA: Detect connection loss
            MA->>MA: Store queue actions locally
            MA->>API: Sync when reconnected
            API->>TQM: ProcessPendingActions()
        end
    end
